___", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1230, "answer": {"text": "D", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Importance of detection of the causes in early stages.\nAnswer ____________________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1286, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Reasons why imaging shall be done.\nAnswer _______________________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1372, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Data segregation.\nAnswer __________________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1440, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "Condition in which there is an accumulation of cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) within\nthe brain.\nAnswer _________________7 A small localized area of dead tissue resulting from\nfailure of blood supply.Answer ________________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1487, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "Which age group patients were included in the study?\nAnswer ______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 152}, {"number": 9, "prompt": "What is the reason presented for taking MRI in children with headache?\nAnswer _______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 231, "answer": {"text": "diagnosis of curable lesions", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "What is define as inflammation of the air cavities within the passages of the\nnose?\nAnswer _______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 329, "answer": {"text": "sinusitis", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 11, "prompt": "Was any defect in medical records an inclusion criteria?\nAnswer _________________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 441, "answer": {"text": "no", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 12, "prompt": "Who shows more peculiarities in CT imaging?\nAnswer ________________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 528, "answer": {"text": "boys", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 13, "prompt": "What method was followed if the initial assumptions were abnormal?\nAnswer ______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 601, "answer": {"text": "non-parametric Mann-Whitney", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 14, "prompt": "What is known to be more common with respect to CT scanning?\nAnswer ______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 695, "answer": {"text": "mass and hematoma", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 15, "prompt": "__________ is referred to as a solid swelling of clotted blood within the tissues.", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 156, "answer": {"text": "Hematoma", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 16, "prompt": "The __________ were presented in two sections of descriptive and analytical.", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 243, "answer": {"text": "Statistical Analyzes", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 17, "prompt": "The percentage of boys who underwent CT scan is _________________", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 324, "answer": {"text": "61%", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 18, "prompt": "_______________ can be defined as a brain condition that occurs in the fetus\nwhen the lateral ventricles become dilated", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 394, "answer": {"text": "Ventriculomegaly", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 19, "prompt": "A _____________ is any disease of the nervous system in which the myelin\nsheath of neurons is damaged.", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 518, "answer": {"text": "Demyelinating Disease", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 20, "prompt": "______________ can be defined as the general physiological process of\nreabsorption and breakdown of tissues.", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 625, "answer": {"text": "Atrophy", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}, {"id": "8d0cd4bf90d4c326-p6", "label": "Part B · PART B", "part": "B", "sourceSha256": "8d0cd4bf90d4c32619f24dd2ba912e9e900ede261eaef79d5d37e74259114b04", "pages": [6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "According to the notice given\nhealth rate improved from 2003-2017\nmany disparities present in 2012-2017 widened over time\nincrease in physical activity led to improved health score\nNutrition\nBetween 2003 to 2004 and 2016 to 2017 in the United States, the mean AHA\nhealthy diet score improved in both children and adults. The prevalence of an ideal\nhealthy diet score increased from 0.2 percent to 0.6 percent in children and from\n0.7 percent to 1.5 percent in adults. These improvements were largely attributable\nto increased whole grain consumption and decreased sugar-sweetened beverage\nconsumption in both children and adults, as well as a small, non-significant trend\nin increased fruit and vegetable consumption. No major trends were evident in\nchildren or adults in progress toward the targets for consumption of fish or sodium.\nBetween 2012 and 2017, although AHA healthy diet scores tended to improve in\nall race/ethnicity, income, and education levels, there has been constant\ninequalities as well. with generally smaller improvements seen in minority groups\nand those with lower income or education.\nAbout one in every three US adults or 30.4 percent, do not engage in leisure time\nphysical activity. Hispanic and Non-Hispanic black adults were more likely to be\ninactive. Among students in grades 9-12, only about 27.1 percent meet the\nAmerican Heart Association recommendation of 60 minutes of exercise every day.\nMore high school boys (36 percent) than girls (17.7 percent) reported having been\nphysically active at least 60 minutes per day on all 7 days.", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 208, "answer": {"text": "many disparities present in 2012-2017 widened over time", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "What is correct?\nEbola virus is common among Waganta population\nThere has been widespread prevalence of the virus in Iboko\nVirus in Bikoro is spreading at a rate closer to Waganta\nDistribution of Ebola virus disease cases by health zone in Democratic Republic of the Congo, 1 April\n– 9 July 2018\nDescription              Bikoro          Iboko         Wangata            Total\nCases\nNew Suspected            3               2             0                  5\nNew Probable             0               0             0                  0\nNew Confirmed            0               0             0                  0\nTotal New Cases          3               2             0                  5\nCumulative Cases\nTotal Suspected          3               2             0                  5\nTotal Probable           11              4             0                  15\nTotal Confirmed          10              24            4                  38\nTotal Number of Cases 24                 30            4                  58", "sourcePage": 11, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "There has been widespread prevalence of the virus in Iboko", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}, {"id": "8d0cd4bf90d4c326-p12", "label": "Part C · READING 9.pdf", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "8d0cd4bf90d4c32619f24dd2ba912e9e900ede261eaef79d5d37e74259114b04", "pages": [12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19], "questions": [{"number": 8, "prompt": "Which of the following is not a sign of yellow fever?\nBack pain\nVomiting\nNausea\nDry tongue", "sourcePage": 14, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 877, "answer": {"text": "Dry tongue", "source": {"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-ab90ee302d4c6640667d", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 9.pdf", "sha256": "ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ab90ee302d4c6640667df25cfc898cf55c97ad37d5500a132d5696f45f2308bc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}]}
